## AdGroupsApi

### Get ad group analytics
## Get ad group analytics
GET https://api.pinterest.com/v5/ad_accounts/{{ad_account_id}}/ad_groups/analytics?startDate={{startDate}}&endDate={{endDate}}&adGroupIds={{adGroupIds}}&columns={{columns}}&granularity={{granularity}}&clickWindowDays={{clickWindowDays}}&engagementWindowDays={{engagementWindowDays}}&viewWindowDays={{viewWindowDays}}&conversionReportTime={{conversionReportTime}}&aggregateReportRows={{aggregateReportRows}}&reportingTimezone={{reportingTimezone}}
Accept: application/json

### Get audience sizing
## Get audience sizing
POST https://api.pinterest.com/v5/ad_accounts/{{ad_account_id}}/ad_groups/audience_sizing
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
 "auto_targeting_enabled": "<string>",
 "creative_types": "<string>",
 "keywords": "<string>",
 "placement_group": "<string>",
 "product_group_ids": "<string>",
 "targeting_spec": "<string>"
}


### Create ad groups
## Create ad groups
POST https://api.pinterest.com/v5/ad_accounts/{{ad_account_id}}/ad_groups
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
 
}


### Get ad group
## Get ad group
GET https://api.pinterest.com/v5/ad_accounts/{{ad_account_id}}/ad_groups/{{ad_group_id}}
Accept: application/json

### List ad groups
## List ad groups
GET https://api.pinterest.com/v5/ad_accounts/{{ad_account_id}}/ad_groups?bookmark={{bookmark}}&pageSize={{pageSize}}&order={{order}}&campaignIds={{campaignIds}}&adGroupIds={{adGroupIds}}&entityStatuses={{entityStatuses}}&translateInterestsToNames={{translateInterestsToNames}}
Accept: application/json

### Update ad groups
## Update ad groups
PATCH https://api.pinterest.com/v5/ad_accounts/{{ad_account_id}}/ad_groups
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
 
}


### Get bid floors
## Get bid floors
POST https://api.pinterest.com/v5/ad_accounts/{{ad_account_id}}/bid_floor
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
 "bid_floor_specs": "<string>",
 "targeting_spec": "<string>"
}


### Get dynamic titles CSV download URL
## Get dynamic titles CSV download URL
GET https://api.pinterest.com/v5/ad_accounts/{{ad_account_id}}/ad_groups/{{ad_group_id}}/dynamic_titles/csv
Accept: application/json

### Get dynamic titles status
## Get dynamic titles status
GET https://api.pinterest.com/v5/ad_accounts/{{ad_account_id}}/ad_groups/{{ad_group_id}}/dynamic_titles/status
Accept: application/json

### Get dynamic titles upload URL
## Get dynamic titles upload URL
GET https://api.pinterest.com/v5/ad_accounts/{{ad_account_id}}/ad_groups/{{ad_group_id}}/dynamic_titles/uploads
Accept: application/json

### Process dynamic titles CSV
## Process dynamic titles CSV
POST https://api.pinterest.com/v5/ad_accounts/{{ad_account_id}}/ad_groups/{{ad_group_id}}/dynamic_titles
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
 "request_id": "<string>"
}


### Get targeting analytics for ad groups
## Get targeting analytics for ad groups
GET https://api.pinterest.com/v5/ad_accounts/{{ad_account_id}}/ad_groups/targeting_analytics?adGroupIds={{adGroupIds}}&startDate={{startDate}}&endDate={{endDate}}&targetingTypes={{targetingTypes}}&columns={{columns}}&granularity={{granularity}}&clickWindowDays={{clickWindowDays}}&engagementWindowDays={{engagementWindowDays}}&viewWindowDays={{viewWindowDays}}&conversionReportTime={{conversionReportTime}}&attributionTypes={{attributionTypes}}&reportingTimezone={{reportingTimezone}}&sortColumns={{sortColumns}}&sortAscending={{sortAscending}}
Accept: application/json

### List of ad groups using promotions IDs.
## List of ad groups using promotions IDs.
GET https://api.pinterest.com/v5/ad_accounts/{{ad_account_id}}/promotion_applied_entities?bookmark={{bookmark}}&pageSize={{pageSize}}&order={{order}}&promotionIds={{promotionIds}}
Accept: application/json
